<title>INDONESIA: Indonesian rubber market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Indonesian rubber market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia's rubber markets are closed on Monday for the Moslem Eid al-Fitr holiday. ose at 694.28 points on Thursday after falling to 685.74 points in early trade. The market reopens on February 12.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
